Components go here.

hello.wasm is not in this repository: a component is code, and which component
an appliance runs is a deployment decision rather than a property of the
image. Build one and drop it in, and the overlay carries it — at which point
its contents are in the solution hash, and "which logic shipped on which
device" has an answer.

    wat2wasm hello.wat -o packs/wasm-runtime/files/opt/components/hello.wasm

The unit refuses to start without it rather than starting and doing nothing,
which is the same reasoning as the model placeholder in packs/inference.
